The mail server I'm setting up is using Ultra5 boxes with Sun
StorEdge A1000 disk arrays. Does anyone know what sort of RAID
controller it contains (we're getting the RAID-in-hardware
version rather than the just-a-box-of-disks D1000 version) and,
if so, whether there's ever likely to be a Linux driver for them.
I'd have preferred running Linux with PCs and DPT arrays but for
finger-pointing reasons we're getting everything from Sun. The
powers that be are happy with using Linux as an O/S in general so
once Ultralinux stabilises it might be worth considering moving
to Linux instead of Solaris. Driver support is the only problem.

